20 s ±  0.340 s    [User: 2.597 s, System: 0.693 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    3.753 s …  4.825 s    50 runs\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR is on average 0.1s faster to startup and shut down the editor on an empty project.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102129#pullrequestreview-2580611487","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102129","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102129#pullrequestreview-2580611487"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102129"}},"submitted_at":"2025-01-29T10:32:43Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2580619578,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Z0SE6","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102129#pullrequestreview-2580619578","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102129","author_associa